# A local function with no signature is generalized (Type System ch. 5, as a `let` is,
# pick LG): `Same` is passed as a value at `Nat` and at `Text` in one body. Written by
# Claude on the claude-lowering branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
use Ui.*

Both: fn [Nat], [Text] -> Text
fn Both ns, ts:
    fn Same x = x
    "{Len (Each ns, Same)} {Concat (Each ts, Same)}"

@page: @unit
@page:
    Ui.Label($text=$"{Both [[1, 2]], [["a", "b"]]}")
